    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "P. Marry & Associates presents to the market this spacious and well proportioned three bedroom town house with converted attic located in the desirable Mill View development. Within two minutes’ walk of the Mill and Mill pond and all the recreational facilities it provides and just a short walk from the town centre, shops, church and beaches. Boasting many special features including a private rear garden, this home is guaranteed to impress all who view."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: (5.09m X 1.74m)     Wood floor, telephone point, coving & Ceiling roses, understairs storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining room: (5.42m X 2.95m)     Wall & floor mounted units, tiled floor, part tiled walls, ornate cornice, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher.\r\n\r\nLiving room: (5.03m X 4.39m)     Feature fireplace, T.V. point, wood floor, coving, recessed lights,  ceiling roses, French doors opening to private rear garden.\r\n\r\nLanding:    Coving, smoke alarm, recessed lights, hot press\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: (4.08m X 2.25m)    Built -in wardrobes, recessed lights.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: (3.19m X 2.04m)\r\n\t\r\nBedroom 3: (4.39m X 3.15m)    Built-in wardrobes, recessed lights, T.V. point.\r\nEn-suite:  (2.25m X 0.83m) W.C., W.H.B., Shower unit, tiled floor, tiled walls, ceiling fan.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: (2.25m X 1.74m)     W.C., W.H.B.,  Bath, tiled floor, tiled walls, recessed light, coving, feature wall mirror.\r\n\r\nAttic conversion: ((5.15m X 4.39m)    Eaves storage, two sky lights, recessed lights, wood floor.\r\nEn-suite: (2.14m X 0.82m)W.C., W.H.B., Shower unit, feature wall mirror, smoke alarm.\r\n\r\nGARDENS:\r\nFRONT: Driveway, cul-de-sac location\r\nREAR : Not overlooked, patio area, lawn, outside light."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "SPECIAL FEATURES:\r\nTown centre location\r\nAlarm system \r\nFeature high ceilings\r\nMaster bedroom en-suite\r\nAttic conversion with en-suite\r\nDouble glazed throughout\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nIn good condition throughout"
      },
      {
